 * localized precommit payload, so the microbenchmark hashes exactly what the
 * firmware hashes. Generated with libsodium on the host; the signature is
 * valid, which matters because an invalid one can be rejected early and would
 * time faster than the work being measured.
 *
 * EDGE holds the encodings that separate a correct verifier from a merely fast
 * one: the eight small-order points of the curve, a non-canonical field
 * element, and p-1/p/p+1. */

